and when you have your 5 models

01:42:44.000 --> 01:42:47.000
then comes your 5th and most important step

01:42:47.000 --> 01:42:50.000
that you will run your own evaluation on it

01:42:50.000 --> 01:42:53.000
on those 5 models

01:42:53.000 --> 01:42:56.000
and those 5 models

01:42:56.000 --> 01:42:59.000
when your own evaluation set will run

01:42:59.000 --> 01:43:02.000
and the results that they will give, then you will get your top candidate

01:43:02.000 --> 01:43:05.000
so here one line that you have to remember

01:43:05.000 --> 01:43:08.000
this is the most important line that you have to take

01:43:08.000 --> 01:43:11.000
from this session that leaderboards

01:43:11.000 --> 01:43:14.000
are not a selection tool

01:43:14.000 --> 01:43:17.000
leaderboards are a filtering tool

01:43:17.000 --> 01:43:20.000
not a decision tool, meaning you don't go to leaderboard

01:43:20.000 --> 01:43:23.000
and decide that I will use this model

01:43:23.000 --> 01:43:26.000
